	(1476, 'admin.article.edit.importCopyTail', 'zh-CN', '而不是绑定：之后改文章不会改页面，改页面也不会改文章 —— 两边各有各的真源，互不影响。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html'),
	(1477, 'admin.article.edit.importCopyTail', 'en-US', ' rather than a binding: later edits to the article do not change the page, and edits to the page do not change the article — each side keeps its own source of truth.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html'),
	(1478, 'admin.article.edit.importPreviewLead', 'zh-CN', '预览读的是', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html'),
	(1479, 'admin.article.edit.importPreviewLead', 'en-US', 'The preview reads the ', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html'),
	(1480, 'admin.article.edit.importPreviewStrong', 'zh-CN', '已保存', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html'),
	(1481, 'admin.article.edit.importPreviewStrong', 'en-US', 'saved', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html'),
	(1482, 'admin.article.edit.importPreviewTail', 'zh-CN', '的正文（预览与创建必须基于同一份内容，否则「预览没问题的」和「创建出来的」会不一样）：改完正文先保存，再预览。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html'),
	(1483, 'admin.article.edit.importPreviewTail', 'en-US', ' body (the preview and the creation must work from the same content, otherwise "the preview looked fine" and "what was created" will differ): save the body first, then preview.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html'),
	(1484, 'admin.article.edit.importWhitelistLead', 'zh-CN', '只有存得进正文的元素才能被导入。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html'),
	(1485, 'admin.article.edit.importWhitelistLead', 'en-US', 'Only elements that survive the body can be imported.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html'),
	(1492, 'admin.article.edit.importEmptyBody', 'zh-CN', '正文还是空的 —— 导入会得到零个组件，先去上面写点内容。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html'),
	(1493, 'admin.article.edit.importEmptyBody', 'en-US', 'The body is still empty — the import would produce zero components; write some content above first.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html'),
	(1494, 'admin.article.edit.importProjectLabel', 'zh-CN', '目标工程', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.353792+08', 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html'),
