	(1926, 'admin.customer_detail.orders.spend_hint.mid', 'zh-CN', '的订单实付总额：待付款的单还没付钱，取消与退款的单的钱没有留下 —— 把三类都算进去会得到一个「比实际流水大」的数字。切换上面的工程可以看他在别的站点的情况。这里只给摘要：具体单据在', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.366509+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.366509+08', 'admin', 'admin/customer_detail.html'),
	(1927, 'admin.customer_detail.orders.spend_hint.mid', 'en-US', ': pending-payment orders have not been paid, and cancelled or refunded orders left no money behind — counting all three would give a figure "larger than the actual cash flow". Switching the project above shows the customer''s activity on another site. Only a summary is given here: the individual orders live in ', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.366509+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.366509+08', 'admin', 'admin/customer_detail.html'),
	(1928, 'admin.customer_detail.orders.spend_hint.strong', 'zh-CN', '已付款 / 已发货 / 已完成', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.366509+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.366509+08', 'admin', 'admin/customer_detail.html'),
	(1929, 'admin.customer_detail.orders.spend_hint.strong', 'en-US', 'paid / shipped / completed', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.366509+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.366509+08', 'admin', 'admin/customer_detail.html'),
	(1930, 'admin.customer_detail.orders.spend_hint.tail', 'zh-CN', '里，上面「最近一单」的订单号点进去就是那一单。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.366509+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.366509+08', 'admin', 'admin/customer_detail.html'),
	(1931, 'admin.customer_detail.orders.spend_hint.tail', 'en-US', ' — the order number under "latest order" above links straight to that order.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.366509+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.366509+08', 'admin', 'admin/customer_detail.html'),
