	(3494, 'catIntro', 'zh-CN', '分类是树：可以建父子层级（父级下拉里带缩进），同级按排序号排；工程内 slug 唯一，另带分类图与 SEO 标题 / 描述。商品可以挂多个分类并指定其中一个为主分类；被商品引用的分类不能删除。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/product_categories.html'),
	(3495, 'catIntro', 'en-US', 'Categories form a tree: you can build parent/child levels (the parent dropdown is indented) and siblings are ordered by their sort value. The slug is unique within the project, and each category carries an image plus an SEO title / description. A product can be attached to several categories with one of them marked primary; a category that a product references cannot be deleted.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/product_categories.html'),
