	(3598, 'tagNewHint', 'zh-CN', '类型选「自动」时才读取规则与参数：新品填 days，价格区间填 minPrice / maxPrice（至少一个），促销规则无参数。类型选「手工」时规则与参数一概忽略。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/product_tags.html'),
	(3599, 'tagNewHint', 'en-US', 'Rules and parameters are only read when the type is Automatic: use days for new arrivals, minPrice / maxPrice (at least one) for a price range, and no parameters for the sale rule. With the Manual type, rules and parameters are ignored entirely.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/product_tags.html'),
