	(3693, 'tplIntro', 'en-US', 'One product type can hold several named templates, each versioned on its own (the version number increments on every change). When publishing a product you may pick one; instances without an explicit choice are published with the default template of their type.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/product_detail_template.html'),
