	(3776, 'admin.inventory.warehouse.lead', 'zh-CN', '仓库是实体：有短码、名称与状态，', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html'),
	(3777, 'admin.inventory.warehouse.lead', 'en-US', 'A warehouse is an entity: it has a short code, a name and a status, and ', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html'),
	(3778, 'admin.inventory.warehouse.bold', 'zh-CN', '必须有一个默认仓', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html'),
	(3779, 'admin.inventory.warehouse.bold', 'en-US', 'there must be a default warehouse', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html'),
	(3780, 'admin.inventory.warehouse.mid', 'zh-CN', '作为「未指定仓库」时的兜底。新建变体时选中的仓库即为该 SKU 的归属仓，系统会在那里生成一条库存记录（初始 0）；SKU 编码以归属仓短码开头（如 ', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html'),
	(3781, 'admin.inventory.warehouse.mid', 'en-US', ' to fall back on when none is specified. The warehouse selected when a variant is created becomes the owning warehouse of that SKU, and a stock record is created there (starting at 0); the SKU code starts with the owning warehouse''s short code (e.g. ', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html'),
	(3782, 'admin.inventory.warehouse.mid2', 'zh-CN', '）—— 前缀表达的是默认发货仓，不是「这个 SKU 只属于这个仓」，同一个 SKU 可以在多个仓各有一行库存。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html'),
	(3783, 'admin.inventory.warehouse.mid2', 'en-US', ') — that prefix expresses the default shipping warehouse, not "this SKU only belongs to that warehouse": the same SKU can have one stock row in each of several warehouses.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html'),
	(3784, 'admin.inventory.source.lead', 'zh-CN', '库存以「SKU × 仓库」为维度，这里显示的是', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html'),
	(3785, 'admin.inventory.source.lead', 'en-US', 'Stock is keyed by SKU × warehouse, and what this page shows is the ', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html'),
	(3786, 'admin.inventory.source.bold', 'zh-CN', '库存真源', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html'),
