	(4125, 'admin.inventory_sources.intro.boldRelated', 'en-US', 'related-party flag', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
	(4126, 'admin.inventory_sources.intro.tail', 'zh-CN', '独立于类型，是「这笔交易是不是关联交易」的判据，报表按「类型 × 关联方」两维交叉取数。外部供应商也可以被标成关联方（同一实控人下的另一家公司）。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
	(4127, 'admin.inventory_sources.intro.tail', 'en-US', ' is independent of the type and is the test for "is this transaction a related-party transaction". Reports cross-tabulate type × related party. An external supplier can be flagged as a related party too (another company under the same ultimate controller).', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
	(4128, 'admin.inventory_sources.intro2.lead', 'zh-CN', '不同来源的字段形状天然不同，异构的对接信息统一放进', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
	(4129, 'admin.inventory_sources.intro2.lead', 'en-US', 'Different sources naturally have different field shapes, so heterogeneous integration details all go into the ', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
	(4130, 'admin.inventory_sources.intro2.bold', 'zh-CN', '对接配置（JSON 对象）', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
	(4131, 'admin.inventory_sources.intro2.bold', 'en-US', 'integration config (JSON object)', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
	(4132, 'admin.inventory_sources.intro2.tail', 'zh-CN', '：类型 / 关联方 / 结算价 / 状态都必须结构化（报表要按它们分组、采购单要按它们校验），只有对接配置是自由形状。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
	(4133, 'admin.inventory_sources.intro2.tail', 'en-US', ': type / related party / settlement price / status must all be structured (reports group by them and purchase orders validate against them); only the integration config has a free shape.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
	(4134, 'admin.inventory_sources.stats.title', 'zh-CN', '关联方报表区分（类型 × 关联方）', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
	(4135, 'admin.inventory_sources.stats.title', 'en-US', 'Related-party report breakdown (type × related party)', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
	(4136, 'admin.inventory_sources.stats.hint', 'zh-CN', '统计不带状态过滤：停用只是「不再选用」，历史关联交易的口径不该随停用而改变。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
	(4137, 'admin.inventory_sources.stats.hint', 'en-US', 'These counts ignore the status filter: disabling a source only means "no longer selectable", and the figures of past related-party transactions should not change when it is disabled.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
	(4138, 'admin.inventory_sources.stats.total', 'zh-CN', '货源总数', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.421206+08', 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html'),
