	(4620, 'admin.blocks.blocks_empty', 'zh-CN', '还没有区块。区块用于跨页面复用的结构片段（对应 WP 的同步块），工作台「全局块」页签可一键引用。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.463553+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.463553+08', 'admin', 'admin/blocks.html'),
	(4621, 'admin.blocks.blocks_empty', 'en-US', 'No blocks yet. Blocks are structure fragments reused across pages (the WordPress synced block equivalent); the Global blocks tab in the workbench inserts them in one click.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.463553+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.463553+08', 'admin', 'admin/blocks.html'),
