	(4892, 'admin.analytics.daily.empty.tail', 'zh-CN', '才会有数据 —— 打点脚本是随产物一起发出去的（统计代码在构建期烘进 HTML），改配置不会回溯已有产物。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/analytics.html'),
	(4893, 'admin.analytics.daily.empty.tail', 'en-US', ' is what creates data — the beacon script ships with the artifacts (the analytics code is baked into the HTML at build time), so changing settings never retroactively applies to artifacts that were already built.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/analytics.html'),
