	(5228, 'admin.i18n.intro', 'zh-CN', '后台外壳、组件固定文案都从这张表取词。此前它们只能靠迁移 seed 修改 —— 改一句错别字要写迁移文件、重跑迁移、重新部署，所以实际能改文案的人只有写代码的人。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/i18n.html'),
	(5229, 'admin.i18n.intro', 'en-US', 'The admin shell and the fixed component copy are all read from this table. Until now they could only be changed through migration seeds — fixing a typo meant writing a migration, re-running it and redeploying, so the only people who could edit copy were the people who wrote code.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/i18n.html'),
	(5230, 'admin.i18n.label.category', 'zh-CN', '分类', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/i18n.html'),
