	(5326, 'admin.masterdata.entities.hint', 'zh-CN', '点「查看历史」即锁定该实体（等价于在上面填实体类型 + 实体 id）。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5327, 'admin.masterdata.entities.hint', 'en-US', 'Click "View history" to lock onto that entity (the same as filling in entity type + entity id above).', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5328, 'admin.masterdata.filter.hint', 'zh-CN', '实体类型 + 实体 id 一起填即锁定单个实体，页面给出它的完整字段级时间线；时间区间是半开区间：since 含当天、until 含当天（内部转成次日零点）。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5329, 'admin.masterdata.filter.hint', 'en-US', 'Filling in both entity type and entity id locks onto a single entity and shows its complete field-level timeline; the date range is half-open: since includes that day, until includes that day (converted to the next midnight internally).', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5330, 'admin.masterdata.filter.title', 'zh-CN', '筛选（按实体查变更历史）', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5331, 'admin.masterdata.filter.title', 'en-US', 'Filter (change history for one entity)', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5332, 'admin.masterdata.intro1.after', 'zh-CN', '：谁在什么时候把哪条主数据的哪个字段从什么改成了什么（商品 / 变体 / 货源）。一次写操作改了几个字段就是几条记录，新增与删除同样逐字段落行。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5333, 'admin.masterdata.intro1.after', 'en-US', ': who changed which field of which master-data record, from what to what (products / variants / sources). One write that touches several fields produces several rows, and inserts and deletes are recorded field by field too.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5334, 'admin.masterdata.intro1.lead', 'zh-CN', '这张表记的是', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5335, 'admin.masterdata.intro1.lead', 'en-US', 'Each row records a ', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5336, 'admin.masterdata.intro1.strong', 'zh-CN', '配置变更', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5337, 'admin.masterdata.intro1.strong', 'en-US', 'configuration change', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5338, 'admin.masterdata.intro2.after1', 'zh-CN', '分工不同：流水记「库存数量怎么变的」（入库 / 出库 / 盘点），本表记「主数据字段怎么变的」。同一次采购收货会同时出现在两处 —— 流水里是「+10」，这里是「成本价 12.00 → 13.50」，回答的是两个问题。记录一旦写入', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5339, 'admin.masterdata.intro2.after1', 'en-US', ': the ledger tracks how stock quantities changed (receipts / issues / counts), while this table tracks how master-data fields changed. The same purchase receipt shows up in both — the ledger says "+10", this table says "cost price 12.00 → 13.50", answering two different questions. Once written, a record is ', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5340, 'admin.masterdata.intro2.lead', 'zh-CN', '它与', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5341, 'admin.masterdata.intro2.lead', 'en-US', 'It plays a different role from the ', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5342, 'admin.masterdata.intro2.strong1', 'zh-CN', '库存流水', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5343, 'admin.masterdata.intro2.strong1', 'en-US', 'stock ledger', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5344, 'admin.masterdata.intro2.strong2', 'zh-CN', '不可改写', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5345, 'admin.masterdata.intro2.strong2', 'en-US', 'immutable', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5346, 'admin.masterdata.intro2.tail', 'zh-CN', '（数据库层拒绝 UPDATE / DELETE），本页也没有编辑入口。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
	(5347, 'admin.masterdata.intro2.tail', 'en-US', ' (the database rejects UPDATE / DELETE), and this page offers no edit entry point.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html'),
