	(6350, 'admin.pages.help.intro', 'en-US', 'Pages are hand-built artifacts: edit the draft on the canvas (workbench), then build and publish it to the delivery side. Translations opens that page''s translation workbench; staged, not published means the draft has been built but not activated live.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.563828+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.563828+08', 'admin', '第四轮后台页面改造新增文案位'),
	(6351, 'admin.pages.help.intro', 'zh-CN', '页面是手工搭建的产物：在画布（工作台）里编辑草稿，构建后发布到访问面。列表里的「多语言」进入该页的译文工作台；「已暂存待发布」表示草稿已经构建过但还没激活到线上。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.563828+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.563828+08', 'admin', '第四轮后台页面改造新增文案位'),
