	(6408, 'admin.products.rating.help', 'en-US', 'Ratings live in their own detail table: the average and count are derived from it, and editing a rating never touches the product''s own fields. No ratings and rated 0 are different things - the former does not take part in minimum-rating filters.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.563828+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.563828+08', 'admin', '第四轮后台页面改造新增文案位'),
	(6409, 'admin.products.rating.help', 'zh-CN', '评分是独立明细：平均值与条数由明细算出，改评分不改动商品字段；「没有评分」与「评分 0 分」是两回事，它不参与最低评分筛选。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.563828+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.563828+08', 'admin', '第四轮后台页面改造新增文案位'),
