	(4846, 'admin.admins.empty', 'zh-CN', '创建后可在「角色」里分配权限；停用或封禁某个账号，直接在列表里操作。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.683358+08', 'admin', 'admin/administrators.html'),
	(4847, 'admin.admins.empty', 'en-US', 'Assign roles after creating one; to disable or ban an account, use the list directly.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.683358+08', 'admin', 'admin/administrators.html'),
	(5480, 'admin.roles.empty', 'zh-CN', '角色决定管理员能看到哪些菜单、能调用哪些接口。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.683358+08', 'admin', 'admin/roles.html'),
	(5481, 'admin.roles.empty', 'en-US', 'A role decides which menus an administrator sees and which APIs they may call.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.683358+08', 'admin', 'admin/roles.html'),
	(5412, 'admin.permissions.empty', 'zh-CN', '权限点由路由注册处声明并在启动期自动同步；只有补漏时才需要手工新建。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.683358+08', 'admin', 'admin/permissions.html'),
	(5413, 'admin.permissions.empty', 'en-US', 'Permission codes are declared at route registration and synced automatically at startup; create one by hand only to cover an extra API.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.683358+08', 'admin', 'admin/permissions.html'),
	(5104, 'admin.datarules.empty', 'zh-CN', '规则按数据域限制可见的行与字段；建好后在编辑页配置屏蔽字段与过滤条件。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.683358+08', 'admin', 'admin/datarules.html'),
	(5105, 'admin.datarules.empty', 'en-US', 'A rule limits which rows and fields a data domain returns; configure omitted fields and conditions on its edit page.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.492156+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.683358+08', 'admin', 'admin/datarules.html'),
