	(7962, 'admin.theme.confirm_delete_note', 'zh-CN', '该主题的颜色 / 字体 / 页眉页脚设置会一并删除；挂在这套主题下的页面会自动改挂到当前激活主题。激活中的主题不能删除，请先切换到其它主题。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.748791+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.748791+08', 'admin', 'admin/project/theme.html: 删除主题确认说明'),
	(7963, 'admin.theme.confirm_delete_note', 'en-US', 'Deleting this theme also deletes its color / font / header-footer settings; pages pinned to this theme move to the active theme automatically. The active theme cannot be deleted — switch to another theme first.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.748791+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.748791+08', 'admin', 'admin/project/theme.html: 删除主题确认说明'),
