	(10111, 'admin.settings.scripts.head_invalid', 'zh-CN', '自定义 Head 代码不合法：不能包含 <!DOCTYPE> / <html> / <head> / <body> 这类结构性标签，且不超过 16 KiB', 400, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'error', 'internal/module/project/enums/site_scripts_keys.go'),
	(10112, 'admin.settings.scripts.head_invalid', 'en-US', 'Invalid custom Head code: it must not contain structural tags such as <!DOCTYPE> / <html> / <head> / <body>, and it must stay under 16 KiB.', 400, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'error', 'internal/module/project/enums/site_scripts_keys.go'),
	(10113, 'admin.settings.scripts.body_invalid', 'zh-CN', '自定义 Body 代码不合法：不能包含 <!DOCTYPE> / <html> / <head> / <body> 这类结构性标签，且不超过 16 KiB', 400, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'error', 'internal/module/project/enums/site_scripts_keys.go'),
	(10114, 'admin.settings.scripts.body_invalid', 'en-US', 'Invalid custom Body code: it must not contain structural tags such as <!DOCTYPE> / <html> / <head> / <body>, and it must stay under 16 KiB.', 400, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'error', 'internal/module/project/enums/site_scripts_keys.go'),
	(10115, 'admin.settings.field.head_scripts', 'zh-CN', '自定义 Head 代码（高级）', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10116, 'admin.settings.field.head_scripts', 'en-US', 'Custom Head code (advanced)', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10117, 'admin.settings.hint.head_scripts', 'zh-CN', '整段粘贴第三方统计 / 营销代码（GA4、Meta Pixel、Clarity、Hotjar 等），发布时注入所有页面 </head> 之前、独占一行。保存后', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10118, 'admin.settings.hint.head_scripts', 'en-US', 'Paste third-party analytics or marketing snippets (GA4, Meta Pixel, Clarity, Hotjar, ...) as one block; at publish time it is injected on its own line before </head> of every page. After saving,', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10119, 'admin.settings.hint.head_scripts.republish', 'zh-CN', '需要重新发布页面', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10120, 'admin.settings.hint.head_scripts.republish', 'en-US', 'pages must be republished', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10121, 'admin.settings.hint.head_scripts.tail', 'zh-CN', '才会写进产物。留空或清空即不注入：产物里一个字节都不会多。这里的内容会<strong>原样</strong>进入对外页面（不转义、不改写），等于把脚本执行权交给它的来源 —— 请只填可信来源，并注意这些脚本能读到访客在本站的数据。保存时拒绝整页 HTML（含 <html> / <head> / <body> 标签）与超过 16 KiB 的内容。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10122, 'admin.settings.hint.head_scripts.tail', 'en-US', 'for it to reach the published artifacts. Leave it empty to inject nothing — not a single byte is added. Whatever you put here goes into public pages <strong>verbatim</strong> (no escaping, no rewriting), which hands script execution power to its source: only use sources you trust, and note that such scripts can read visitor data on this site. Saving rejects full HTML documents (containing <html> / <head> / <body>) and anything over 16 KiB.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10123, 'admin.settings.ph.head_scripts', 'zh-CN', '留空即不注入。例：&lt;script src=&#34;https://cdn.example.com/tag.js&#34; async&gt;&lt;/script&gt;', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10124, 'admin.settings.ph.head_scripts', 'en-US', 'Empty means nothing is injected. Example: &lt;script src=&#34;https://cdn.example.com/tag.js&#34; async&gt;&lt;/script&gt;', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10125, 'admin.settings.field.body_scripts', 'zh-CN', '自定义 Body 代码（高级）', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10126, 'admin.settings.field.body_scripts', 'en-US', 'Custom Body code (advanced)', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10204, 'admin.membership.entitlement.none', 'en-US', 'No benefits configured', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', 'admin', 'internal/templates/admin/membership/*.html'),
	(10127, 'admin.settings.hint.body_scripts', 'zh-CN', '整段粘贴需要在正文之后加载的第三方代码（在线客服浮窗、转化追踪等），发布时注入所有页面 </body> 之前、独占一行（排在站点自己的脚本之后）。判据与 Head 代码完全相同：留空即不注入，拒绝整页 HTML 与超过 16 KiB 的内容。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10128, 'admin.settings.hint.body_scripts', 'en-US', 'Paste third-party code that must load after the body content (live-chat widgets, conversion tracking, ...); at publish time it is injected on its own line before </body> of every page (after the site own scripts). The rules match Head code exactly: empty means nothing is injected, and full HTML documents or anything over 16 KiB are rejected.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10129, 'admin.settings.ph.body_scripts', 'zh-CN', '留空即不注入。例：&lt;script src=&#34;https://cdn.example.com/chat.js&#34; async&gt;&lt;/script&gt;', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
	(10130, 'admin.settings.ph.body_scripts', 'en-US', 'Empty means nothing is injected. Example: &lt;script src=&#34;https://cdn.example.com/chat.js&#34; async&gt;&lt;/script&gt;', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.868587+08', 'ui', 'internal/templates/admin/project/settings.html'),
