	(10215, 'admin.membership.intro', 'zh-CN', '等级按工程定义：同一访客在不同工程可以是不同等级（消费额也按工程算）。门槛填的是「元」，系统按分存储与比较，与订单金额口径一致。每工程必须恰好有一个默认等级 —— 还没有归属的访客按它计算。自动升级在每日结算时按累计消费额重算；手工指定的归属不会被自动重算覆盖。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', 'admin', 'internal/templates/admin/membership/*.html'),
	(10216, 'admin.membership.intro', 'en-US', 'Tiers are defined per project: the same customer can hold different tiers in different projects (spend is counted per project too). Enter thresholds in yuan; the system stores and compares them in cents, matching the order amount scale. Every project must have exactly one default tier, used for customers with no assignment yet. Automatic upgrades are recomputed from cumulative spend on the daily run; manually assigned members are never overwritten by it.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', 'admin', 'internal/templates/admin/membership/*.html'),
	(10217, 'admin.membership.lastError', 'zh-CN', '上一次操作未完成：', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', 'admin', 'internal/templates/admin/membership/*.html'),
	(10218, 'admin.membership.lastError', 'en-US', 'The last operation did not finish: ', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', 'admin', 'internal/templates/admin/membership/*.html'),
	(10219, 'admin.membership.link.assignments', 'zh-CN', '会员归属', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', 'admin', 'internal/templates/admin/membership/*.html'),
