	(10249, 'admin.membership.tier.empty', 'zh-CN', '先建一个默认等级（门槛 0），再按消费额往上加档。没有默认等级时，会员身份解析会直接失败。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', 'admin', 'internal/templates/admin/membership/*.html'),
	(10250, 'admin.membership.tier.empty', 'en-US', 'Create a default tier first (threshold 0), then add higher tiers by spend. Without a default tier, membership resolution fails outright.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.874514+08', 'admin', 'internal/templates/admin/membership/*.html'),
