	(10343, 'admin.customer_detail.membership.hint', 'zh-CN', '等级按「站点工程 + 客户账号」解析：同一个客户在不同工程可以是不同等级。这里只读 —— 指定等级与解除锁定在「会员归属」页。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.889621+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.889621+08', 'admin', 'internal/templates/admin/user/customer_detail.html'),
	(10344, 'admin.customer_detail.membership.hint', 'en-US', 'Tiers are resolved per site project plus customer account, so the same customer can hold different tiers in different projects. This block is read-only; assigning a tier or unlocking one happens on the Memberships page.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.889621+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.889621+08', 'admin', 'internal/templates/admin/user/customer_detail.html'),
