	(10615, 'admin.article.edit.seoMergedHint', 'zh-CN', '搜索引擎结果页显示的标题就是上面的「标题」、描述就是「摘要」—— 不用再填一遍（这两栏已合并）。这里只剩主关键词这一项。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.930554+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.930554+08', 'admin', '文章编辑页：SEO 字段合并说明'),
	(10616, 'admin.article.edit.seoMergedHint', 'en-US', 'The title and description shown in search results are the Title and Excerpt above — no need to fill them twice (the two fields are merged). Only the focus keyword remains here.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.930554+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.930554+08', 'admin', '文章编辑页：SEO 字段合并说明'),
	(10617, 'ErrLocaleNoTranslations', 'zh-CN', '该语言还没有任何界面词条，不能启用：请先在「文案管理」里补齐该语言的词条，再回来启用。', 400, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.973515+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.973515+08', 'project', 'U1 站点级语言准入：新增/新启用的语言在 sys_i18n 的启用词条数必须 > 0'),
	(10618, 'ErrLocaleNoTranslations', 'en-US', 'This language has no interface strings yet and cannot be enabled. Add its strings in "Translations" first, then enable it.', 400, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.973515+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:55.973515+08', 'project', 'U1 site-level locale admission: a newly added/enabled language needs at least one active sys_i18n entry'),
