	(11384, 'admin.dashboard.top.col.product', 'zh-CN', '商品', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:56.044279+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:56.044279+08', 'admin', 'admin/dashboard.html: 热销商品表头（商品）'),
	(5907, 'admin.dashboard.intro', 'zh-CN', '统计口径：KPI 与趋势按 UTC 日界（与访问统计同口径），“今日”指 UTC 当天。销售额为净额 = 计入消费的订单金额 − 已实际收货的退款额，货币为站点默认货币。「热销商品」只统计已付款/已发货/已完成的订单，商品名与 SKU 是下单当时的快照，金额不含退款分摊。全部为实时查询，不做缓存。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.550912+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:56.044279+08', 'admin', 'admin/dashboard.html: 统计口径说明（悬浮）'),
	(5906, 'admin.dashboard.intro', 'en-US', 'How these numbers are computed: KPIs and the trend use UTC day boundaries (the same as analytics), so "today" means the UTC day. Sales is net = paid-order amounts minus refunds actually received, in the site default currency. Top products counts only paid/shipped/completed orders; names and SKUs are the snapshots taken at order time and amounts exclude refund allocation. Everything is queried live, nothing is cached.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:55.550912+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:56.044279+08', 'admin', 'admin/dashboard.html: 统计口径说明（悬浮）'),
