	(13223, 'pPubHistLead', 'zh-CN', '每一次发布尝试都记在这里，含自动重建与失败：失败会留下原因原文。默认显示最近 10 次。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:56.297126+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:56.297126+08', 'product', 'internal/templates/admin/product/product_publish_records.html'),
	(13224, 'pPubHistLead', 'en-US', 'Every publish attempt is recorded here, including automatic rebuilds and failures: a failure keeps the original error text. The latest 10 are shown by default.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:56.297126+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:56.297126+08', 'product', 'internal/templates/admin/product/product_publish_records.html'),
	(13225, 'pPubHistHint', 'zh-CN', '行内「发布历史」列出这个商品的每一次发布尝试（含自动重建与失败），默认最近 10 次，可加载更多。', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:56.297126+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:56.297126+08', 'product', 'internal/templates/admin/product/product_publish_records.html'),
	(13226, 'pPubHistHint', 'en-US', 'The in-row Publish history button lists every publish attempt for this product, including automatic rebuilds and failures; the latest 10 are shown first and more can be loaded.', 200, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:56.297126+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:56.297126+08', 'product', 'internal/templates/admin/product/product_publish_records.html'),
