	(13776, 'pHintAttrs', 'en-US', 'Attribute groups are defined on the product attributes page and can be shared by many products. Categories and brands are defined on their own pages; a product can have several categories (one marked primary) and one brand. Tags are defined on the product tags page; manual tags are attached by hand and rule tags keep their membership automatically.', 0, 1, '2026-11-15 20:36:56.536015+08', '2026-11-15 20:36:56.536015+08', 'product', '商品界面完整句'),
